{"seq":3,"slug":"advanced-patterns","title":"高级 Operator 模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/advanced-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"status-conditions","title":"Status Conditions 设计协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/advanced-patterns/status-conditions","wordCount":1136,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"finalizers-ownership","title":"Finalizers 与所有权管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/advanced-patterns/finalizers-ownership","wordCount":1210,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-cluster-operators","title":"多集群 Operator 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/advanced-patterns/multi-cluster-operators","wordCount":1271,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"高级-operator-模式\">高级 Operator 模式</h1><p>本章深入 Operator 开发中需要精心设计的高级模式。Status Condition 是 Operator 与用户、与其他控制器通信的标准协议——设计不当会导致状态不可读、debug 困难；Finalizer 与 OwnerReference 构成资源清理与垃圾回收的基础设施——误用会引发资源泄漏或死锁；多集群 Operator 则将控制平面的边界从单集群扩展到联邦，带来全新的一致性与网络拓扑挑战。</p>\n<p>三篇文档聚焦生产级 Operator 中最常出错的领域。建议按顺序阅读：先掌握 Status 的设计协议，再理解资源生命周期管理的完整机制，最后探索多集群场景下的架构模式。</p>\n"}